{"entry_id": "session_20260707_153544_3c48dfdc:orchestrated:20260707153944410186:answer_unit:2", "entry_type": "answer_unit", "turn_id": "session_20260707_153544_3c48dfdc:orchestrated:20260707153944410186", "source_kind": "answer", "source_ref": "session_20260707_153544_3c48dfdc:orchestrated:20260707153944410186:answer:2", "content": "**结论：** 法院应坚持“谁主张谁举证”原则，同时主动审查专利有效性", "structured_payload": {"unit_index": 2}, "confidence": "high", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-07-07T15:39:44+08:00"}
{"entry_id": "session_20260707_153544_3c48dfdc:orchestrated:20260707153944410186:answer_unit:3", "entry_type": "answer_unit", "turn_id": "session_20260707_153544_3c48dfdc:orchestrated:20260707153944410186", "source_kind": "answer", "source_ref": "session_20260707_153544_3c48dfdc:orchestrated:20260707153944410186:answer:3", "content": "*   **法律依据：** 《专利法》第五十九条第二款要求外观设计专利权的保护范围以表示在图片或者照片中的该产品的外观设计为准，简要说明可以用于解释图片或者照片", "structured_payload": {"unit_index": 3}, "confidence": "high", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-07-07T15:39:44+08:00"}
